exports[`email templates > renders the backup failed email to HTML and text > backup failed text 1`] = `
"Acme Labs


A backup failed

The scheduled backup that started 7 Oct 2026, 09:30 UTC did not finish.

The backup destination refused the upload: disk full.

Until a backup succeeds, the last verified one is the newest restore point.

Open backups https://bemmoly.example.com/settings/backups

You're receiving this because you watch PLT-204.

Unsubscribe https://bemmoly.example.com/unsubscribe?token=abc.def · Notification settings https://bemmoly.example.com/settings/notifications

----------------------------------------

Sent by Bemmoly for Acme Labs."
`;

