exports[`email templates > renders the password reset email to HTML and text > password reset subject 1`] = `"Reset your Acme Labs password"`;

exports[`email templates > renders the password reset email to HTML and text > password reset text 1`] = `
"Acme Labs


Reset your password

Hi Rohan, someone asked to reset the password for your Acme Labs account. Choose a new one with the button below.

Choose a new password https://bemmoly.example.com/reset/tok

The link works once and expires 7 Oct 2026, 09:30 UTC. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email; your password stays the same.

You're receiving this because Aisha K. invited this address.

----------------------------------------

Sent by Bemmoly for Acme Labs."
`;

