-weight:600;padding:9px 16px;padding-top:9px;padding-right:16px;padding-bottom:9px;padding-left:16px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:13.5px" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:6.75px">Review the update</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:16px 4px 0"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#8a93a3;margin:0 0 6px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">You&#x27;re receiving this because you watch PLT-204.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#8a93a3;margin:0 0 6px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0"><a href="https://bemmoly.example.com/unsubscribe?token=abc.def" style="color:#4b5565;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a> · <a href="https://bemmoly.example.com/settings/notifications" style="color:#4b5565;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank">Notification settings</a></p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e2e5ea;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:12px 0"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#8a93a3;margin:0 0 6px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">Sent by Bemmoly for Acme Labs.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

exports[`email templates > renders the update available email to HTML and text > update available subject 1`] = `"Bemmoly 0.2.0 is available"`;

exports[`email templates > renders the update available email to HTML and text > update available text 1`] = `
"Acme Labs


Bemmoly 0.2.0 is available

An update is ready for Acme Labs (you run 0.1.0). A backup is taken before it is applied, and a failed health check rolls it back.

Release notes: https://bemmoly.example.com/notes

Review the update https://bemmoly.example.com/settings/updates

You're receiving this because you watch PLT-204.

Unsubscribe https://bemmoly.example.com/unsubscribe?token=abc.def · Notification settings https://bemmoly.example.com/settings/notifications

----------------------------------------

Sent by Bemmoly for Acme Labs."
`;
